# Firebase
firebase-debug.log
firebase-debug.*.log
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
.firebase/

# Firebase client config (google-services.json, firebase_options.dart) is
# deliberately COMMITTED, not ignored. The API key in it is a public
# identifier, not a secret — Firebase security comes from Auth and Firestore
# rules. Committing it means a fresh clone builds without a manual console
# download, which matters with three people on the team.
